  "title": "Ramipril Shortage in the UK Extended Until October 2026: What Patients Need to Know",
  "summary": "The UK has extended the shortage protocol for 1.25mg ramipril capsules until October 2026. Learn why supplies remain limited, what it means for patients, and the steps to take if your medication is affected. Thousands of people across the United Kingdom who rely on ramipril for managing high blood pressure and other heart conditions continue to face limited medicine supplies. Health authorities have extended the Serious Shortage Protocol (SSP) for 1.25mg ramipril capsules until October 30, 2026",
